  "title": "Russian Plain is ours",
  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Russian Plain through its freight sidings. Download the records from the vault server, take down the site warden, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 10 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
